UnitVolatilePool::Mint
├── given the pool current totalSupply is zero
│   ├── when the liquidity to mint is below MINIMUM_LIQUIDITY
│   │   └── it should revert with InsufficientLiquidityMinted
│   └── when the liquidity to mint is above MINIMUM_LIQUIDITY
│       ├── it should mint the minimum liquidity to address one
│       ├── it should mint the remaining liquidity to the recipient
│       └── it should emit the Mint event
└── given the pool current totalSupply is positive
    ├── when the liquidity to mint is zero
    │   └── it should revert with InsufficientLiquidityMinted
    └── when the liquidity to mint is positive
        ├── it should mint the proportional liquidity to the recipient
        └── it should emit the Mint event
